---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: clicksend (SMS (ClickSend))

## minimal config
{
  "api_key": "secret-api_key",
  "to": "+4712345678",
  "username": "username-value"
}

### down
POST https://rest.clicksend.com/v3/sms/send
Authorization: Basic dXNlcm5hbWUtdmFsdWU6c2VjcmV0LWFwaV9rZXk=
(json)
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "body": "🔴 Payments API is down — HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
      "source": "vigilant-vole",
      "to": "+4712345678"
    }
  ]
}

### up
POST https://rest.clicksend.com/v3/sms/send
Authorization: Basic dXNlcm5hbWUtdmFsdWU6c2VjcmV0LWFwaV9rZXk=
(json)
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "body": "🟢 Payments API is back up — down for 12m 4s\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
      "source": "vigilant-vole",
      "to": "+4712345678"
    }
  ]
}

## full config
{
  "api_key": "secret-api_key",
  "from": "Vole",
  "to": "+4712345678",
  "username": "username-value"
}

